#: 75700a4abfdf42f6ae0de33829d67b8c
msgid "Note that the / separators in the name of the graph control how the graph will appear in the Graphs menu tree. So for example if you save a graph with a name of \"Copter/Analysis/WPNav Analysis\" then a \"WPNav Analysis\" menu item will be added to the Copter->Analysis submenu, automatically creating the submenus as needed."
