#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:163
#: f72653d4536c4bdfbc05da02e3b264db
msgid "Also note that each graph expression should be on a line by itself. If you have multiple lines for the expressions then they will be considered as alternative expressions (to cope with different types of logs)."
